{"id":"wb-5-302","name":"吕府","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"吕府","text":"吕府位于中国浙江省绍兴市越城区新河弄169号，是明嘉靖年间礼部尚书吕本的府邸，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n吕府建于明万历年间，占地约20000平方米，坐北朝南，以三条纵轴、五条横轴围成十三个院落。单体建筑均为硬山式，构件很少雕饰。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%95%E5%BA%9C","revisionId":91060101,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91060101","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8c0253c5bec236d04dd17961.jpg","title":"Former_Residence_of_Lv_Ben_in_Shaoxing_2012-07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_Residence_of_Lv_Ben_in_Shaoxing_2012-07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/Former_Residence_of_Lv_Ben_in_Shaoxing_2012-07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​绍兴新河弄明嘉靖礼部尚书吕本府邸。","width":320,"height":240}}